  "title": "Grilled Jalapeño Poppers",
  "description": "These grilled jalapeño poppers are stuffed with a creamy Cheddar cheese mixture, wrapped in bacon, and cooked until crispy and irresistible.",
  "authors": [
    "Philip Dally"
  ],
  "date_published": "2010-07-24T19:02:59-04:00",
